0 drop-on-beams (Brickwright Robot Lab validation machine)
0 Name: drop-on-beams.ldr
0 Author: Brickwright
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Drop test (Robot Lab validation, test/bw-sim-validation.test.mjs).
0 // Two beam 15 lie flat on the floor side by side (z = -20 and +20, holes vertical); a 2 x 4 brick is held
0 // crosswise 125 LDU (5 cm) above them, resting nowhere: it falls, lands across both beams and must stop on
0 // them. Nothing is connected: these are loose parts by design (the test lifts the brick higher for the
0 // tunnelling cases).
0 !BW ID beamA
1 72 0 0 -20 0 0 1 0 1 0 -1 0 0 32278.dat
0 !BW ID beamB
1 72 0 0 20 0 0 1 0 1 0 -1 0 0 32278.dat
0 !BW ID brick
1 4 0 -159 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3001.dat
